lmpar  @72a77822
  watch per iteration  par, parl, paru, fp
  hold at lower        parl >= 0.0                                        "the lower bound is not negative"
  hold at finish       par >= 0.0                                         "par is not negative"
  hold at finish       iter == LMPAR_MAXITER or fp <= LMPAR_TOL * delta   "the step is at most 10% longer than the trust radius"
  hold at finish       iter == 0 or iter == LMPAR_MAXITER or parl == 0.0 or abs(sqrt(sum((diag * x) * (diag * x))) - delta) <= LMPAR_TOL * delta   "a step with par > 0 solves the secular equation to a tenth of delta, unless lmpar ran out of iterations or had no lower bound"
  watch at gn_length   dxnorm, fp, delta
  watch at lower       parl
  watch at upper       paru, gnorm
  watch at start       par
  watch at evaluate    par, dxnorm, fp
  watch at newton      parc
